# 保护二进制文件：禁止 CRLF 转换（避免 PDF/图片损坏）
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.svg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.mp4 binary
*.json text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
